# API 设计规范

## RESTful

### 资源命名

```bash
GET    /users          # 列表
POST   /users          # 创建
GET    /users/:id      # 详情
PUT    /users/:id      # 更新
DELETE /users/:id      # 删除
```bash

### 响应格式

```json
{
  "data": { "id": 1, "name": "John" },
  "meta": { "page": 1, "total": 100 }
}
```bash

### 状态码

```bash
200 OK
201 Created
204 No Content
400 Bad Request
401 Unauthorized
403 Forbidden
404 Not Found
500 Internal Server Error
```bash

## GraphQL

### Schema

```graphql
type User {
  id: ID!
  name: String!
  posts: [Post!]!
}

type Query {
  user(id: ID!): User
  users(first: Int, after: String): UserConnection
}

type Mutation {
  createUser(input: CreateUserInput!): User!
}
```bash

## 版本控制

### URL 版本

```bash
/api/v1/users
/api/v2/users
```bash

### Header 版本

```bash
Accept: application/vnd.myapp.v2+json
```bash

## 最佳实践

1. 使用名词复数
2. 过滤/分页/排序
3. 错误信息清晰
4. API 文档完善

